~ intro
$> Cutscene.lock_player()
Prof. Alder: Hold on there!
$> Cutscene.move("prof", "7,7")
$> Cutscene.face("prof", "player")
$> Cutscene.face("player", "prof")
Prof. Alder: So you're the new tamer everyone's been talking about.
Prof. Alder: Nobody walks into the tall grass without a partner. Come with me to the lab.
$> Story.set_flag("met_prof")
$> Cutscene.change_map("town_01_lab", "entry")
$> Cutscene.unlock_player()
=> choose

~ too_early
$> Cutscene.lock_player()
???: Wait! It's dangerous to go into the grass without a creature!
$> Cutscene.move("player", "15,3")
$> Cutscene.unlock_player()
=> END

~ prof_town
Prof. Alder: My lab is just here. Come on in.
=> END

~ prof
if Story.flag("got_starter")
	Prof. Alder: Route 1 is north of town. Go and see what's out there!
	=> END
=> choose

~ choose
if Story.flag("got_starter")
	Prof. Alder: You already have a partner. Go and see what's out there!
	=> END
$> Story.set_flag("met_prof")
Prof. Alder: Three creatures, three temperaments. Which one will be your partner?
- Tidepup, a calm water pup
	$> Story.give_creature("tidepup", 5, true)
- Emberkit, a hot-headed fire kit
	$> Story.give_creature("emberkit", 5, true)
- Sprigling, a patient grass sprout
	$> Story.give_creature("sprigling", 5, true)
$> Story.give_item("lure_cage", 5)
$> Story.set_flag("got_starter")
Prof. Alder: A good match. Take these Lure Cages as well.
=> rival

~ rival
Rival: Wait up! I got one too, and I want to try it out.
$> Story.start_battle("rival_lab", false)
if Story.last_battle_won()
	Rival: ...Fine. Beginner's luck.
else
	Rival: Ha! Better luck next time.
	Prof. Alder: I've patched your team up. Don't let it get you down.
$> Story.set_flag("rival_lab_done")
Rival: I'll be waiting on Route 1.
=> END

~ rival_talk
if Story.flag("got_starter")
	Rival: Don't keep me waiting.
else
	Rival: Hurry up and talk to the professor already.
=> END
